<TD WIDTH="2%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">&#149;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top">The purchase and repurchase price for shares of our common stock is based on the NAV of each class of common stock and is not based on any public trading market. Because valuation of properties is inherently subjective,
our NAV may not accurately reflect the actual price at which our assets could be liquidated on any given day. </TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
