<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top">Our advisor faces conflicts of interest as a result of, among other things, time constraints, allocation of investment opportunities and the fact that the fees it receives for services rendered to us are based on our
NAV which it is responsible for calculating. </TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
