marketable securities. </P>  <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><U>Alabama Investors</U>: In addition to the general suitability standards, Alabama investors must have a
