<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><B>How is an investment in shares of your stock different from traditional non-listed REITs? </B></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
