<TD WIDTH="3%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">&#149;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top">shares of traditional non-listed REITs are typically not valued until 18 months after the cessation of their offering, whereas our shares are valued on a daily basis. Changes in our daily NAV will reflect factors
