<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><B>A:</B></TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><B></B>The minimum initial investment in shares of our Class&nbsp;A and Class M common stock is $10,000. The minimum initial investment in shares of our Class A-I and Class M-I common stock is $1,000,000, provided that
the minimum investment amount may be reduced in the discretion of our board of directors or our advisor with respect to investments by our executive officers and directors and their immediate family members and officers and employees of our advisor,
our sponsor or other affiliates. The minimum subsequent investment in shares of any class of our common stock is $1,000 per transaction, except for purchases made under our distribution reinvestment plan. </TD></TR></TABLE>
