 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>We currently have, and may enter into, agreements with subsidiaries of our sponsor to
perform certain services for our real estate portfolio. </I></B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Subsidiaries of our sponsor provide property management, leasing and other
