<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Our retail properties may decline in rental revenue and/or occupancy as a result of co-tenancy provisions contained in certain
