<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Investments in properties or other real estate investments outside the United States subject us to foreign currency risks, which may
adversely affect distributions and our REIT status. </I></B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Revenues generated from any properties or other real estate investments we
