securities will decline, and vice versa. Our investment in such securities means that our NAV may decline if market interest rates rise. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">During periods of rising interest rates, the average life of certain types of securities may be extended because of slower than expected
