basis and for identifying, making and managing acquisitions on our behalf. </P>  <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We believe that access to LaSalle&#146;s investment
expertise, research capabilities and property acquisition sourcing and due diligence capabilities will enable us to successfully execute our investment strategy and objectives. LaSalle has substantial experience in acquiring, owning, managing,
