adjustment in our strategy could have a material adverse effect on us. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">A change in the value of any of our assets could cause us, one or
more of our subsidiaries to fall within the definition of &#147;investment company&#148; and negatively affect our ability to maintain our exemption from regulation under the Investment Company Act. To maintain compliance with this exception from
