<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Our advisor will utilize the Asia Pacific Investment Committee in evaluating potential investment opportunities for our real estate portfolio
throughout the Asia Pacific region. The Asia Pacific Investment Committee will review and approve, by majority vote, each potential investment in a property located in the Asia Pacific region before our advisor may consider the opportunity for our
