<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Mark N. Gabbay</B> is an International Director of LaSalle and Chief Investment Officer and Co-Chief Executive Officer for the Asia Pacific
region. In this role, he is responsible for formulating and implementing LaSalle&#146;s investment strategy in the region, sourcing and structuring opportunities and overseeing the investment process. Mr.&nbsp;Gabbay has been in the real estate
industry for over 18 years, working in the Asia Pacific region for 13 years and the United States for five years. Most recently, he served as Managing Director and Head of Nomura&#146;s Asia Asset Finance Division and as Co-Head of the Global Real
