<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In addition, Maryland law permits us to advance reasonable expenses to a director or officer upon receipt of (1)&nbsp;a written affirmation by
