<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Our board of directors declared quarterly dividends for our stockholders equal to $0.09506 per share for each of the third quarter of 2011 and
