quarters of 2013. In addition, our board of directors declared dividends of $0.11 per share for the fourth quarter of 2013 and first and second quarters of 2014 and $0.12 per share for the third and fourth quarters of 2014. While we intend to
continue to pay regular quarterly distributions to our stockholders, there can be no assurance that sufficient cash will be available to pay distributions to our stockholders in the future or that the amount of the distributions will not either
