<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top">Processed repurchases of more than $100,000 are intended to be paid only via direct deposit. For this reason, stockholders who own more than $100,000 of our common stock must provide banking instructions for their
brokerage account or designated U.S. bank account. Stockholders who own less than $100,000 of our common stock may also receive repurchase proceeds via direct deposit, provided the payment amount is at least $5,000. For all repurchases paid via
