the class of shares purchased, calculated as of the distribution date. Stockholders do not pay selling commissions when purchasing shares pursuant to the distribution reinvestment plan. Because the dealer manager fee is calculated based on our NAV,
it reduces the NAV of each class of our common stock, including shares issued under the distribution reinvestment plan. Shares acquired under the distribution </P>
