<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">If voting rights for control shares are approved at a stockholders&#146; meeting and the acquiror becomes entitled to vote a majority of the
