partnership to the extent of the REIT&#146;s interest as a partner in the partnership. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Certain securities will not cause a violation of
the 10% value test described above. Such securities include instruments that constitute &#147;straight debt.&#148; A security does not qualify as &#147;straight debt&#148; where a REIT (or a controlled TRS of the REIT) owns other securities of the
