stockholder on December&nbsp;31 of such year, provided that the dividend is actually paid before the end of January of the following calendar year. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We may elect to designate a portion of our distributions as &#147;qualified dividend income.&#148; A portion of a distribution that is
