<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Governmental plans, most church plans, and foreign plans (&#147;Other Plans&#148;), while not subject to the fiduciary responsibility
