 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Indemnification does not reduce the exposure of directors and officers to liability under federal
or state securities laws, nor does it limit the stockholders&#146; ability to obtain injunctive relief or other equitable remedies for a violation of a director&#146;s or an officer&#146;s duties to the registrant or its stockholders, although the
equitable remedies may not be an effective remedy in some circumstances. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In addition, the registrant will not indemnify its directors,
its advisor and affiliates of its advisor or any person acting as a broker-dealer for losses and liabilities arising from or out of alleged violations of federal or state securities laws unless one or more of the following conditions are met: </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
